---
const {source,board=false,canPost=false,priorId=''}=Astro.props;
---
<section data-visual-exchange data-board={String(board)} data-project={source?.project.id??''} data-owner={Astro.locals.user?.id} data-prior={priorId}>

<div class="exchange-intro"><p>Choose words and up to three previews from your saved visual work. Save a private draft, review it, then decide whether to share it with registered artists.</p></div>
{!board&&<><p><a href={`/studio/projects/${source.project.id}/journey/?chapter=visual-world`}>Return to my Visual Design Book</a></p><p>Your other project work stays private. Later edits never change an already shared brief.</p>{!source.bookText.trim()&&<p class="studio-notice" role="status">Your Visual Design Book has no saved writing yet. Open it using the link above, save the words you want an artist to see, then return here to choose an excerpt.</p>}<form data-exchange-draft><fieldset disabled={!canPost}><legend>Prepare a private draft</legend><p>Sharing a brief or sending an enquiry does not create a commission or grant artwork rights. Discuss permissions, scope and payment directly before agreeing to work together.</p>{!canPost&&<p>Sharing a visual brief is not available for your account. Your project remains private.</p>}<label>Visual brief title <input name="title" required minlength="3" maxlength="160"/></label><details><summary>Read my saved Visual Design Book</summary><div data-book-reading></div></details><label>Excerpt from my saved Visual Design Book <textarea name="selected_text" required maxlength="10000" rows="6"/></label><fieldset><legend>Example previews I choose (optional)</legend><p>These are your existing saved reference previews. Original production files stay private. A reference is not permission to reproduce it.</p>{(source?.images??[]).map((r:any)=><label class="exchange-check"><input name="image_id" type="checkbox" value={r.id}/><span>{r.note||'Saved reference'}<img src={r.image} alt="Private reference available for explicit selection" width="90"/></span></label>)}</fieldset><button type="submit">Save private draft</button></fieldset></form><h2>My saved visual briefs</h2></>}
<p data-exchange-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div data-exchange-records></div><p>Contact details stay private. Any later introduction uses the existing consent workflow; an artist accepts before contacts are released. Artist contracts and payments remain direct.</p><p><a href={board?'/artists/collaborate/':`/studio/artists/?project=${source.project.id}`}>{board?'My artist profile and introduction requests':'Find artists'}</a></p>
<details class="exchange-backup"><summary>What is included in my project backup?</summary><p>Your complete project ZIP includes saved Exchange drafts and history visible to you. Imported history stays private and cannot restart sharing or enquiries. Unsaved writing on this page is not included.</p></details><script type="application/json" data-exchange-source set:html={JSON.stringify(board?null:source).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')}/>
</section>
<script>import '../../scripts/visualExchange';</script>
<style>[data-visual-exchange]{max-width:68rem}[data-visual-exchange] label{display:block;margin:1rem 0}[data-visual-exchange] input:not([type=checkbox]),[data-visual-exchange] textarea,[data-visual-exchange] :global([data-exchange-records] textarea){width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:.7rem;font:inherit;background:#fff;border:1px solid #9d9e94;border-radius:3px}[data-visual-exchange] button,[data-visual-exchange] :global([data-exchange-records] button){font:inherit;padding:.55rem .8rem;min-height:2.75rem;border:1px solid #7b826f;border-radius:3px;background:#faf8f2;color:#24332c;cursor:pointer}[data-visual-exchange] button:disabled{background:#deded9;color:#4b5563;cursor:not-allowed}[data-visual-exchange] fieldset{min-width:0;border:1px solid #c9c0ad;padding:1rem}[data-visual-exchange] img,[data-visual-exchange] :global([data-exchange-records] img){max-width:100%;max-height:18rem;object-fit:contain}[data-visual-exchange] :global([data-exchange-records] article){border-top:1px solid #c9c0ad;padding:1rem 0}[data-visual-exchange] :global(p){line-height:1.7;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.exchange-check span{display:grid;gap:.4rem}.exchange-check,[data-visual-exchange] :global(.exchange-check){display:flex!important;align-items:start;gap:.6rem}[data-visual-exchange] input[type=checkbox]{margin-top:.3rem;flex-shrink:0}[data-visual-exchange] summary{cursor:pointer}[data-visual-exchange] :global(button:focus-visible),[data-visual-exchange] summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #315e67;outline-offset:3px}[data-visual-exchange] [hidden]{display:none!important}</style>

<style>.exchange-intro{max-width:70ch}.exchange-intro ol{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem 2rem;padding-left:1.3rem}.exchange-intro li{flex:1 1 12rem}.exchange-backup{margin-top:1.5rem}[data-exchange-draft]>fieldset>button{background:#a88739;color:#152d33;border-color:#a88739}.exchange-intro h2{font-size:1.5rem}</style>

<style>[data-visual-exchange] :global(.exchange-inline-help){position:relative;min-height:1.8rem;margin:.6rem 0}[data-visual-exchange] :global(.exchange-inline-help>summary){position:relative;inset:auto}[data-visual-exchange] :global(.exchange-inline-help>.studio-field-wisdom-panel){position:relative;inset:auto;margin-top:.5rem}</style>
